# CLFLUSHOPT—Flush Cache Line Optimized -- override
# 'Flush_Cache_Line_Optimized(SRC);' -- v1 has no caches; the operand is read so
# the access faults as the instruction would. (The page's Operation ends in
# a footnote about ModRM.mod, which isn't pseudocode.)
@operation
tmp := Memory8[EffectiveAddress(DEST)];
